NOTICE
======

This repository contains two kinds of content, under different terms.

1. Metadata (symbols/)
---------------------
The JSON symbol reference files are factual listings data (ticker, name,
exchange, region, currency, instrument type). Facts are not copyrightable.
These files are provided as-is, with no warranty of accuracy, completeness or
fitness for any purpose, and must not be relied upon for trading decisions.

2. Logos and marks (logos/)
---------------------------
The images in logos/ are the trademarks, service marks and/or logos of their
respective owners. They are NOT owned by, licensed to, or affiliated with the
maintainers of this repository.

They are included solely for nominative use: to identify the company, fund or
digital asset that a given ticker symbol refers to, in the same way a
publication prints a company's logo alongside a story about that company.

  * No endorsement, sponsorship, affiliation or partnership is claimed or
    implied between any mark owner and this repository or its maintainers.
  * The images are unmodified representations of each owner's mark, apart from
    format normalisation (conversion to PNG and resizing).
  * No trademark rights are granted by this repository. Downstream use of any
    mark remains subject to that mark owner's own terms and to applicable
    trademark law in your jurisdiction.

Removal requests
----------------
If you own a mark included here and want it removed, open an issue in this
repository and it will be taken down. No justification is required.

Accuracy
--------
Symbol-to-logo mapping is automated and imperfect. A ticker may be matched to
the wrong entity, particularly for funds (which generally resolve to an
issuer-level mark rather than a fund-specific one) and for tickers reused
across exchanges. Report errors via an issue.
